\begin{thm}\label{theoreme4}There exist  functions $\tilde \epsilon_0: [1,\infty)\mapsto (0,1]$, $F: (0,1]\mapsto [1,+\infty)$, $\tilde h_0: (0,1]\times [1,\infty)\mapsto(0,1]$,
