The energy resolution is evaluated using the Mn K$\alpha$ peak, leveraging its high-statistics data across all three arrays. For improved precision, the local energy scale is calibrated using the Mn K$\alpha_1$ and K$\alpha_2$ peaks \cite{holzer_$kensuremathalpha_12$_1997}. Fig.\,\ref{fig:spe0} shows the Mn K$\alpha$ peak resolution for the best pixel in Array 0.
