%|\Delta_{k,a}(I_{n+m,\nu})|\leq Ca^{n+m-l(\nu)-k}|1-2a|^{l(\nu)-k}(n+m)^k.
%\]
%If $I_{n+m,\nu}$ is a subinterval of $I_{n,j}$, then $l(\nu)\geq l$ and we can simplify the above estimate to
