As shown in the Tab.\ref{data_year}, compared with the long-term training data used by mainstream ocean models such as Xihe, Wenhai, Langya, etc., we used shorter time range data for training and achieved better prediction results. For data-driven deep learning methods, we can accurately capture ocean phenomena and features by relying solely on pure ocean variables such as T, S, U, V and SSH.
