\[E_1=\{(0,1)\edge(3,2),(0,2)\edge(3,1),(0,3)\edge(1,1),(1,2)\edge(2,1),(5,1)\edge(4,1)\},\]
and $\Th_1^*$ have the following diagrams (left and right hand diagrams, respectively)
