\begin{proof} We claim $\mathit{Bs}_{(d,(P_1,s_1))}^{-}(\Th)=(F',E')$, where $\mathit{Bs}_{(d,(P_1,s_1))}^{-}$ is the sequence of handle slides obtained from the sequence of chord slides $\mathit{bs}_{(d,(P_1,s_1))}^{-}$ (\textit{c.f.} \ref{def:slideover}) in the obvious way.\end{proof}

