\begin{prop}\label{decomp} Let $\Th \in Sq_{\tor}(n,m)$ and let $\Psi \in Sq_{\mob} (l,k)$. Then there exist non-negative integers $\l$, $\mu$, $a$,  and $\nu$, $b$, and rank 0 SWB data $T_1\in Sq_0(n,\l+\mu+a)$, $T_2\in Sq_0(\l+\mu+a,m)$, and $T_3\in Sq_0(l,\nu+b)$, $T_4\in Sq_0(\nu+b,k)$,  such that
