 Let  $f=(f^1,\cdots, f^m):W \subset \mathcal{E}\rightarrow \R^m$($m\geq 2 $), we say that $f\in H_{k+\alpha}(W)$ if $|f|_{k+\alpha,W}:=\sum_{A=1}^m |f^A|_{k+\alpha}(W)<\infty$.
