\subsection{Static structural properties}
To get an idea of the static structure of the cluster we obtain RDF, C2P and angular correlation functions and plotted them at different values of coupling and screening parameters. We obtain these properties using both frictionless Molecular Dynamics and Langevin Dynamics simulation. It is expected that the static properties doesn't change with the dynamics considered.
